+
+Request: add `createPatch(from, to)` exported from `src/index.ts`, returning an RFC 6902 JSON Patch that turns
+`from` into `to`, without mutating either input.
+
+Done: object members diffed recursively (add/remove/replace); arrays diffed by longest common subsequence, so
+inserted or removed items yield single `add`/`remove` ops and a moved item yields a remove plus an add; only
+differing items are touched. Pointer tokens are escaped (`~0`, `~1`). Tests added in `src/index.test.ts`.
